Date: Sat, 04 Apr 2015 07:29:41 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-users] From JAGS to Stan: hierarchical logistic regression stuck at the first iteration
Message-ID: <LExiKWPw8Vk.i2SH_LjlHLsJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <LExiKWPw8Vk.YIeStel6EU8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <LExiKWPw8Vk.YIeStel6EU8J@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/LExiKWPw8Vk/m/i2SH_LjlHLsJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
