Subject: How to use the posterior sample obtained for parameters as prior for another model?
Message-ID: <ImgxE5T-Oh0.qxyKCCmne6QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/ImgxE5T-Oh0/m/qxyKCCmne6QJ>
