Subject: Re: [stan-users] How to use the posterior sample obtained for parameters as prior for another model?
Message-ID: <ImgxE5T-Oh0.SEfcMLJAaVUJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <ImgxE5T-Oh0.qxyKCCmne6QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <ImgxE5T-Oh0.qxyKCCmne6QJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/ImgxE5T-Oh0/m/SEfcMLJAaVUJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
