From u368f61d9252655a2 at groups.google.com  Wed Apr  8 14:19:43 2015
From: u368f61d9252655a2 at groups.google.com (Herra Huu)
Date: Wed, 08 Apr 2015 14:19:43 +0000
Subject: Re: Logistic GP
Message-ID: <Sp8q2T_ZwKw.H9GBPe9xTkIJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <Sp8q2T_ZwKw.6zweWPluTeQJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
