>
> Thanks,
> Dennis
>
> t is real
> c&q are complex valued
> c_{n} = \frac{c_{n-1}\cdot q_{n}+\tanh(tq_{n})}{1+c_{n-1}\cdot q_{n}\cdot \tanh(tq_{n})}\frac{1}{q_{n}}
>

