> I think there is a minus sign missing in the adjustment, shouldn't this rather be:
>   increment_log_prob(-pow(phi,-2));
>
> @Janne: I'm wondering if you had a general rationale (or even a reference to the literature) for choosing this half-normal prior on 1/phi, or was the logic rather linked to your specific application?
>
> Thanks,
> Thomas
